 <section className="maintenance" aria-live="polite"><div><strong>{config.bookingEnabled?'Beta bookings are open':'Bookings aren’t open just yet'}</strong><p>{config.bookingEnabled?'Selected beta areas can now request a clean.':config.message}</p></div><a href={`https://wa.me/${config.whatsapp}`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp support</a></section>
 <section className="split" id="value"><div><p className="eyebrow">FOR CUSTOMERS</p><h2>Less chasing.<br/>More certainty.</h2><p>See real offers, cleaner credentials and progress in one calm, transparent place.</p><ul><li><Check/>Choose an offer that suits your budget</li><li><Check/>Know who is coming before they arrive</li><li><Check/>Keep messages, payment and proof together</li></ul>{cta('Join as a customer')}</div><div className="dark-card"><p className="eyebrow">FOR CLEANERS</p><h2>Good work should build a business.</h2><p>Find nearby opportunities, set competitive bids and grow a reputation customers can trust.</p><div className="stat-row"><span><b>YOU</b> choose jobs</span><span><b>YOU</b> set bids</span></div><a href="#cleaners">Explore cleaner benefits <ArrowRight size={17}/></a></div></section>
 <section id="how" className="how"><div className="section-head"><p className="eyebrow">ONE CLEAR JOURNEY</p><h2>From request to spotless,<br/>every step is visible.</h2></div><div className="steps">{steps.map(([n,t,d])=><article key={n}><b>{n}</b><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></section>
 <section id="services" className="services"><div className="section-head"><p className="eyebrow">BUILT FOR REAL LIFE</p><h2>One place for every kind of clean.</h2><p>Launch categories vary by service area and cleaner availability.</p></div><div className="service-grid">{services.map(({icon:Icon,name,text})=><article key={name}><Icon/><h3>{name}</h3><p>{text}</p><a href="#join">Join the waitlist <ArrowRight/></a></article>)}</div></section>
 <section id="trust" className="trust"><div className="trust-visual"><div className="seal"><ShieldCheck/><b>Detail<br/>standard</b></div></div><div><p className="eyebrow">TRUST IS THE PRODUCT</p><h2>Designed for confidence on both sides.</h2><div className="trust-list">{[['Vetted profiles','Identity and cleaner information are reviewed before trust badges appear.'],['Safer payments','Digital payment records and completion confirmation reduce uncertainty.'],['Accountable work','In-app progress, job history and two-way ratings create a clear record.'],['Support when needed','A visible support route helps resolve concerns and report safety issues.']].map(([t,d],i)=><article key={t}><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
 <section id="cleaners" className="recruit"><div><p className="eyebrow">CLEANERS, THIS IS YOURS TOO</p><h2>Turn your standards into your reputation.</h2><p>Whether you work independently or lead a team, Detail helps you find local demand and show customers what makes your work worth choosing.</p><div className="pill-row"><span><Clock3/>Flexible opportunities</span><span><Users/>Visible reputation</span><span><Banknote/>Clear earnings</span></div>{cta('Apply for cleaner access')}</div><div className="cleaner-card"><div className="portrait"><span>TM</span></div><h3>Tariro M.</h3><p>Home & office specialist</p><div><strong>4.9 <Star fill="currentColor"/></strong><small>32 completed jobs</small></div><span className="verified-line"><BadgeCheck/>Vetted profile</span></div></section>
 <section id="areas" className="areas"><MapPin/><div><p className="eyebrow">GROWING ACROSS ZIMBABWE</p><h2>Starting local. Expanding thoughtfully.</h2><p>We’re building early access around Harare and opening new service areas as vetted cleaner coverage grows. Tell us your suburb or city on the waitlist.</p></div><a href="#join" className="secondary">Request your area</a></section>
 <section id="join" className="join"><div><p className="eyebrow">EARLY ACCESS</p><h2>Be first when Detail reaches your area.</h2><p>Join the beta list as a customer or cleaner. Your response helps us decide where to launch next.</p><div className="contact"><h3>Prefer to talk?</h3><p><b>Support:</b> <a href="mailto:support@detailapp.co.zw">support@detailapp.co.zw</a></p><p><b>WhatsApp:</b> <a href="https://wa.me/263714885936">+263 71 488 5936</a></p><p><b>General enquiries:</b> <a href="mailto:info@detailapp.co.zw">info@detailapp.co.zw</a></p></div></div><Waitlist enabled={config.waitlistEnabled}/></section>
 <section id="faq" className="faq"><div className="section-head"><p className="eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW</p><h2>Frequently asked questions.</h2></div><div>{[['Is Detail available now?','Detail is preparing a controlled beta. Join the waitlist and we’ll contact you when your selected area and role become available.'],['How are cleaners vetted?','Cleaner profiles may include identity and documentation checks. The exact badge shown reflects checks completed; no marketplace can eliminate all risk.'],['How will payment work?','Customers review the agreed bid before paying. Digital payments create a record and are released according to completion and dispute rules. Cash availability may vary.'],['Does joining guarantee access?','No. Access is released gradually based on cleaner coverage, service area and operational readiness.'],['Can cleaning businesses apply?','Yes. Independent cleaners and cleaning teams can join the cleaner waitlist and select the services they offer.']].map(([q,a])=><details key={q}><summary>{q}<ChevronDown/></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section className="final"><p className="eyebrow">A BETTER CLEAN STARTS HERE</p><h2>Ready when your area is.</h2>{cta('Join the Detail waitlist')}</section></main>
 <footer><div className="footer-top"><a className="logo light" href="#top"><BrandMark/>DETAIL</a><p>Trusted cleaning, coordinated with clarity.</p><div><b>Support</b><a href="mailto:support@detailapp.co.zw">support@detailapp.co.zw</a><b>WhatsApp support</b><a href="https://wa.me/263714885936">+263 71 488 5936</a><b>General enquiries</b><a href="mailto:info@detailapp.co.zw">info@detailapp.co.zw</a></div></div><div className="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Catalyst Labs. Detail is a Catalyst Labs product.</span><span><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></span></div></footer>
